ICY","query":"台灯 丢失 退款资格 条件 例外","top_k":3}},{"decision":{"kind":"ANSWER","text":"台灯这单的承运结论是 LOST（承运商判定丢失），订单行状态也是 LOST。按本店政策，承运商结论为 LOST 且无有效签收记录时，经人工核验可按该订单行全部数量的实付金额退款（本单实付 ¥129.00，数量 1）。所以可以走退款，但需要人工核验后才可申请。申请入口：正式退款申请请走「我的售后」；售后咨询里的退款摘要确认和 Case 关联尚未接通，聊天里说想退款或提交人工核查不会自动创建退款工单。若需要人工帮助，可在售后咨询中选择该订单商品，点「请商家核查」，预览并编辑转交摘要后确认提交（无需填退款金额，也不会因此提交退款申请）。","citations":["O1","P1","O2"],"handoff_summary":null}},{"decision":{"kind":"ANSWER","text":"台灯这笔订单的承运结论是 LOST（承运商判定丢失），物流事件为：已付款 → 已发货 → 丢失。按本店政策，承运商结论为 LOST 且无有效签收记录时，经人工核验可按该订单行全部数量的实付金额退款（本单为桌面台灯 米白色 ×1，实付 ¥129.00）。因此可以申请退款，但需人工核验后办理。申请入口：正式退款申请请走「我的售后」；售后咨询内的退款摘要确认与 Case 关联尚未接通，在聊天里说想退款不会自动创建退款工单。如需人工核查，可在售后咨询中选择该订单商品，点击「请商家核查」，预览并编辑转交摘要后确认提交。","citations":["O1","P1","O2"],"handoff_summary":null}}],"tools":[{"name":"get_shipment_trace","result":{"source_type":"SHIPMENT","version":3,"data":{"lines":[{"events":[{"code":"ORDER_PAID","occurred_at":"2026-10-20T03:13:35.257912Z","source_version":1},{"code":"SIMULATED_SHIPPED","occurred_at":"2026-10-20T03:13:35.327619Z","source_version":2},{"code":"LOST","occurred_at":"2026-10-20T03:13:35.479423Z","source_version":3}],"status":"LOST","line_id":"SHOP-b9dbad28-81cd-435a-881f-b3f8ef4115b9","source_version":3,"carrier_conclusion":"LOST"}],"status":"LOST","version":3,"order_id":"3b555dea-9916-443b-ba81-93a96ba89a5a","synthetic":true}}},{"name":"get_support_guide","result":{"source_type":"KNOWLEDGE","version":"2026.10.21-v1","title":"售后咨询使用指南","data":{"guide_id":"support-guide-v1","authority":"APPLICATION_GUIDE","text":"选择订单商品与独立咨询\n打开售后咨询后选择本人已付款订单中的商品。每个订单行独立保存咨询消息，更换商品会切换到对应商品的会话，原咨询记录保留。\n\n不申请退款也能请商家核查\n需要人工帮助时，可点击请商家核查，预览并编辑转交摘要后确认提交。不需要填写退款金额，也不会因此提交退款申请。\n\n转交前选择共享原文和调查依据\n转交商家前，客户选择共享哪些客户原文，以及本回答的订单、物流或政策依据。调查依据默认不勾选；对话历史不会随依据自动共享。只有客户确认的内容才发给商家。\n\n私有助手咨询与补充给商家的区别\n转交后默认输入补充给商家，消息进入原核查单。可切换询问智能助手，这类咨询和助手回答不自动交给商家。商家只能读取客户确认共享及后续发给商家的消息。\n\n商家回复与客户确认解决\n商家可以核查回复或请求客户补充。已回复不会自动变成已解决，客户可继续补充或确认解决。解决后客户再次补充会接续原核查单，咨询不限制为两轮补充。\n\n查看核查进度和历史消息\n咨询记录会自动检查进度，也可手动刷新。读取更早消息时暂停自动刷新，避免打断阅读。商家在本店咨询核查工作台查看已确认的共享材料并回复。\n\n发送结果不明确与版本冲突\n网络结果尚未确认时，使用原请求确认结果，刷新同一浏览器标签页后保留原请求标识。版本冲突时保留输入并提示刷新，不自动提交过时的转交摘要。\n\n正式退款申请与咨询入口\n当前可用的正式退款申请入口为我的售后。售后咨询内的退款摘要确认和Case关联尚未接通，聊天表示想退款或提交人工核查并不会自动创建退款工单。\n\n助手回答来源与实时事实\n助手按问题选择读取订单、物流、历史或绑定版本的本店政策。回答来源可展开查看版本和原文；订单当前物流状态、退款执行结果须从业务接口读取，知识文档不能证明某笔订单已发货、已丢失或已退款。\n\n补充纠正与过时回答\n客户生成期间可以继续补充、纠正情况或更换商品。旧输入对应的回复不会发布成最新回答；失败后可以重新提问或请商家核查。","text_sha256":"36cf84fc69f01922f447f5689806988725ed5feb441a2885e795e9a8013266eb","sources":[{"ref":"s0","path":"docs/customer-support-workspace.md","sha256_at_import":"590a885a5a87bd9a042e25cca3cebc3849d980c768e10ddfc867cbcb04f9a046"},{"ref":"s1","path":"docs/customer-agent-implementation-v1.md","sha256_at_import":"3826ffaadd7ea6f55be72a305e1c72c36be8dba7718f9383b6cb9d72633cfdba"}],"sections":[{"id":"K-ORDER","title":"选择订单商品与独立咨询","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"0b9024410e73cb06276d40e13032e841b129006e139c08360062d681bbdaec30"},{"id":"K-HANDOFF","title":"不申请退款也能请商家核查","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"879a4c3ad27ab5621f84ed2eb5cc43cf0e18351ff46081ecb2dbb265961166f0"},{"id":"K-SHARE","title":"转交前选择共享原文和调查依据","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"eea932ba2356c4434fe1d2a89afd819bd70de0d853c0a3520fa48cb663a3fb07"},{"id":"K-PRIVATE","title":"私有助手咨询与补充给商家的区别","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"f5aed43a041386b8781354bc6237a1acc0a5ce41b5aa370134f0cb9f6df082b1"},{"id":"K-RESOLVE","title":"商家回复与客户确认解决","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"2b4c156fca14434c77590441fd3fd4ccc98d8e01ee000de7f4bb7754cf9f9fac"},{"id":"K-STATUS","title":"查看核查进度和历史消息","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"f655a65dee43308fbf3d69bb4cd2bb08b420ff2821569803b9e0b3df9b1f1b87"},{"id":"K-RETRY","title":"发送结果不明确与版本冲突","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"ad62323703821ebce40ab2156956f23d914c571a1f5f1630d1d122e1be9a20be"},{"id":"K-ENTRY","title":"正式退款申请与咨询入口","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"2fe4ceca600510fd2656f2ca4ee760f3ecb913fc41afbe5e32b172308ff76a68"},{"id":"K-SOURCES","title":"助手回答来源与实时事实","source_ref":"s1","content_sha256":"612667d73a8062856b9d7b8b5ee0a170ddbbfadf53cd27e1968f5da779623d93"},{"id":"K-STALE","title":"补充纠正与过时回答","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"c3671d4ce76908e8037a0ec2ebc9ba293b7ae3f26b2100acdbfef1015a64b7d4"}],"knowledge_sha256":"41d1eb95d617ae018f265013afa3fbdad294d2e61423393684ba4114ab2a8cbd"}}},{"name":"search_policy","result":[{"source_type":"POLICY","version":"2026.10","title":"承运商判定丢失","data":{"bundle_id":"policy-foundation-m1002-2026.10","merchant_id":"M-1002","manifest_hash":"b4aae62c56c095b77be64e1819d4d3d3762cc07b121c11070dd4227b1009f8de","rule_id":"R-LOST-001","chunk_id":"c-02","content_hash":"5d939273bd40f52230b820dacdfc970c977b681f445df01f0362d155c7d2242f","text":"承运商结论为 LOST 且无有效签收记录时，经人工核验可按该订单行全部数量的实付金额退款；本地模拟在途不代表承运商丢失。"}},{"source_type":"POLICY","version":"2026.10","title":"商品损坏或质量问题","data":{"bundle_id":"policy-foundation-m1002-2026.10","merchant_id":"M-1002","manifest_hash":"b4aae62c56c095b77be64e1819d4d3d3762cc07b121c11070dd4227b1009f8de","rule_id":"R-DMG-001","chunk_id":"c-04","content_hash":"2b2d7eb3ffde7fc6244c9fe355e4b33cfc385a93eb8557b434ef96991265196e","text":"发货后的损坏或质量退款必须由人工核验客户材料与订单事实，确认符合售后条件后才可申请该订单行全部数量的实付金额退款；普通在途或未经核验的主张不足以批准。"}},{"source_type":"POLICY","version":"2026.10","title":"普通在途","data":{"bundle_id":"policy-foundation-m1002-2026.10","merchant_id":"M-1002","manifest_hash":"b4aae62c56c095b77be64e1819d4d3d3762cc07b121c11070dd4227b1009f8de","rule_id":"R-INTRANSIT-001","chunk_id":"c-05","content_hash":"18786c5e973c12b73be3ba6037a1eae33b2654f2d4d10b05190958baf804941a","text":"IN_TRANSIT 本身不构成物流丢失或退款资格；尚无承运商异常结论且无其他经核验的退款理由时，要求补充信息或转人工，不按未发货规则退款。"}}]}],"calls":[{"kind":"model","position":1,"response_json":{"decision":{"kind":"READ_TOOL","tasks":[{"id":"t1","intent":"LOGISTICS","status":"PENDING","request":"查台灯的承运结论、能否退以及在哪申请","evidence_refs":[],"response_excerpt":null}],"arguments":{},"tool_name":"get_shipment_trace","dialogue_events":[{"quote":"查一下台灯的承运结论、能否退以及在哪申请，三个都想知道。","change":"ADD","offset":0,"task_id":"t1","reference":"CURRENT"}]}}},{"kind":"model","position":2,"response_json":{"decision":{"kind":"READ_TOOL","tasks":[{"id":"t1","intent":"LOGISTICS","status":"PENDING","request":"查台灯的承运结论、能否退以及在哪申请","evidence_refs":["O1"],"response_excerpt":null}],"arguments":{},"tool_name":"get_support_guide","dialogue_events":[{"quote":"查一下台灯的承运结论、能否退以及在哪申请，三个都想知道。","change":"CONTINUE","offset":0,"task_id":"t1","reference":"CURRENT"}]}}},{"kind":"model","position":3,"response_json":{"decision":{"kind":"SEARCH_POLICY","query":"台灯 丢失 退款资格 条件 例外","top_k":3}}},{"kind":"model","position":4,"response_json":{"decision":{"kind":"ANSWER","text":"台灯这单的承运结论是 LOST（承运商判定丢失），订单行状态也是 LOST。按本店政策，承运商结论为 LOST 且无有效签收记录时，经人工核验可按该订单行全部数量的实付金额退款（本单实付 ¥129.00，数量 1）。所以可以走退款，但需要人工核验后才可申请。申请入口：正式退款申请请走「我的售后」；售后咨询里的退款摘要确认和 Case 关联尚未接通，聊天里说想退款或提交人工核查不会自动创建退款工单。若需要人工帮助，可在售后咨询中选择该订单商品，点「请商家核查」，预览并编辑转交摘要后确认提交（无需填退款金额，也不会因此提交退款申请）。","citations":["O1","P1","O2"],"handoff_summary":null}}},{"kind":"model","position":5,"response_json":{"decision":{"kind":"ANSWER","text":"台灯这笔订单的承运结论是 LOST（承运商判定丢失），物流事件为：已付款 → 已发货 → 丢失。按本店政策，承运商结论为 LOST 且无有效签收记录时，经人工核验可按该订单行全部数量的实付金额退款（本单为桌面台灯 米白色 ×1，实付 ¥129.00）。因此可以申请退款，但需人工核验后办理。申请入口：正式退款申请请走「我的售后」；售后咨询内的退款摘要确认与 Case 关联尚未接通，在聊天里说想退款不会自动创建退款工单。如需人工核查，可在售后咨询中选择该订单商品，点击「请商家核查」，预览并编辑转交摘要后确认提交。","citations":["O1","P1","O2"],"handoff_summary":null}}},{"kind":"tool","position":1,"request_json":{"name":"get_shipment_trace","arguments":{}},"response_json":[{"data":{"lines":[{"events":[{"code":"ORDER_PAID","occurred_at":"2026-10-20T03:13:35.257912Z","source_version":1},{"code":"SIMULATED_SHIPPED","occurred_at":"2026-10-20T03:13:35.327619Z","source_version":2},{"code":"LOST","occurred_at":"2026-10-20T03:13:35.479423Z","source_version":3}],"status":"LOST","line_id":"SHOP-b9dbad28-81cd-435a-881f-b3f8ef4115b9","source_version":3,"carrier_conclusion":"LOST"}],"status":"LOST","version":3,"order_id":"3b555dea-9916-443b-ba81-93a96ba89a5a","synthetic":true},"version":3,"source_type":"SHIPMENT"}]},{"kind":"tool","position":2,"request_json":{"name":"get_support_guide","arguments":{}},"response_json":[{"data":{"text":"选择订单商品与独立咨询\n打开售后咨询后选择本人已付款订单中的商品。每个订单行独立保存咨询消息，更换商品会切换到对应商品的会话，原咨询记录保留。\n\n不申请退款也能请商家核查\n需要人工帮助时，可点击请商家核查，预览并编辑转交摘要后确认提交。不需要填写退款金额，也不会因此提交退款申请。\n\n转交前选择共享原文和调查依据\n转交商家前，客户选择共享哪些客户原文，以及本回答的订单、物流或政策依据。调查依据默认不勾选；对话历史不会随依据自动共享。只有客户确认的内容才发给商家。\n\n私有助手咨询与补充给商家的区别\n转交后默认输入补充给商家，消息进入原核查单。可切换询问智能助手，这类咨询和助手回答不自动交给商家。商家只能读取客户确认共享及后续发给商家的消息。\n\n商家回复与客户确认解决\n商家可以核查回复或请求客户补充。已回复不会自动变成已解决，客户可继续补充或确认解决。解决后客户再次补充会接续原核查单，咨询不限制为两轮补充。\n\n查看核查进度和历史消息\n咨询记录会自动检查进度，也可手动刷新。读取更早消息时暂停自动刷新，避免打断阅读。商家在本店咨询核查工作台查看已确认的共享材料并回复。\n\n发送结果不明确与版本冲突\n网络结果尚未确认时，使用原请求确认结果，刷新同一浏览器标签页后保留原请求标识。版本冲突时保留输入并提示刷新，不自动提交过时的转交摘要。\n\n正式退款申请与咨询入口\n当前可用的正式退款申请入口为我的售后。售后咨询内的退款摘要确认和Case关联尚未接通，聊天表示想退款或提交人工核查并不会自动创建退款工单。\n\n助手回答来源与实时事实\n助手按问题选择读取订单、物流、历史或绑定版本的本店政策。回答来源可展开查看版本和原文；订单当前物流状态、退款执行结果须从业务接口读取，知识文档不能证明某笔订单已发货、已丢失或已退款。\n\n补充纠正与过时回答\n客户生成期间可以继续补充、纠正情况或更换商品。旧输入对应的回复不会发布成最新回答；失败后可以重新提问或请商家核查。","sources":[{"ref":"s0","path":"docs/customer-support-workspace.md","sha256_at_import":"590a885a5a87bd9a042e25cca3cebc3849d980c768e10ddfc867cbcb04f9a046"},{"ref":"s1","path":"docs/customer-agent-implementation-v1.md","sha256_at_import":"3826ffaadd7ea6f55be72a305e1c72c36be8dba7718f9383b6cb9d72633cfdba"}],"guide_id":"support-guide-v1","sections":[{"id":"K-ORDER","title":"选择订单商品与独立咨询","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"0b9024410e73cb06276d40e13032e841b129006e139c08360062d681bbdaec30"},{"id":"K-HANDOFF","title":"不申请退款也能请商家核查","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"879a4c3ad27ab5621f84ed2eb5cc43cf0e18351ff46081ecb2dbb265961166f0"},{"id":"K-SHARE","title":"转交前选择共享原文和调查依据","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"eea932ba2356c4434fe1d2a89afd819bd70de0d853c0a3520fa48cb663a3fb07"},{"id":"K-PRIVATE","title":"私有助手咨询与补充给商家的区别","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"f5aed43a041386b8781354bc6237a1acc0a5ce41b5aa370134f0cb9f6df082b1"},{"id":"K-RESOLVE","title":"商家回复与客户确认解决","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"2b4c156fca14434c77590441fd3fd4ccc98d8e01ee000de7f4bb7754cf9f9fac"},{"id":"K-STATUS","title":"查看核查进度和历史消息","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"f655a65dee43308fbf3d69bb4cd2bb08b420ff2821569803b9e0b3df9b1f1b87"},{"id":"K-RETRY","title":"发送结果不明确与版本冲突","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"ad62323703821ebce40ab2156956f23d914c571a1f5f1630d1d122e1be9a20be"},{"id":"K-ENTRY","title":"正式退款申请与咨询入口","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"2fe4ceca600510fd2656f2ca4ee760f3ecb913fc41afbe5e32b172308ff76a68"},{"id":"K-SOURCES","title":"助手回答来源与实时事实","source_ref":"s1","content_sha256":"612667d73a8062856b9d7b8b5ee0a170ddbbfadf53cd27e1968f5da779623d93"},{"id":"K-STALE","title":"补充纠正与过时回答","source_ref":"s0","content_sha256":"c3671d4ce76908e8037a0ec2ebc9ba293b7ae3f26b2100acdbfef1015a64b7d4"}],"authority":"APPLICATION_GUIDE","text_sha256":"36cf84fc69f01922f447f5689806988725ed5feb441a2885e795e9a8013266eb","knowledge_sha256":"41d1eb95d617ae018f265013afa3fbdad294d2e61423393684ba4114ab2a8cbd"},"title":"售后咨询使用指南","version":"2026.10.21-v1","source_type":"KNOWLEDGE"}]},{"kind":"tool","position":3,"request_json":{"name":"search_policy","arguments":{"query":"台灯 丢失 退款资格 条件 例外","top_k":3}},"response_json":[{"data":{"text":"承运商结论为 LOST 且无有效签收记录时，经人工核验可按该订单行全部数量的实付金额退款；本地模拟在途不代表承运商丢失。","rule_id":"R-LOST-001","chunk_id":"c-02","bundle_id":"policy-foundation-m1002-2026.10","merchant_id":"M-1002","content_hash":"5d939273bd40f52230b820dacdfc970c977b681f445df01f0362d155c7d2242f","manifest_hash":"b4aae62c56c095b77be64e1819d4d3d3762cc07b121c11070dd4227b1009f8de"},"title":"承运商判定丢失","version":"2026.10","source_type":"POLICY"},{"data":{"text":"发货后的损坏或质量退款必须由人工核验客户材料与订单事实，确认符合售后条件后才可申请该订单行全部数量的实付金额退款；普通在途或未经核验的主张不足以批准。","rule_id":"R-DMG-001","chunk_id":"c-04","bundle_id":"policy-foundation-m1002-2026.10","merchant_id":"M-1002","content_hash":"2b2d7eb3ffde7fc6244c9fe355e4b33cfc385a93eb8557b434ef96991265196e","manifest_hash":"b4aae62c56c095b77be64e1819d4d3d3762cc07b121c11070dd4227b1009f8de"},"title":"商品损坏或质量问题","version":"2026.10","source_type":"POLICY"},{"data":{"text":"IN_TRANSIT 本身不构成物流丢失或退款资格；尚无承运商异常结论且无其他经核验的退款理由时，要求补充信息或转人工，不按未发货规则退款。","rule_id":"R-INTRANSIT-001","chunk_id":"c-05","bundle_id":"policy-foundation-m1002-2026.10","merchant_id":"M-1002","content_hash":"18786c5e973c12b73be3ba6037a1eae33b2654f2d4d10b05190958baf804941a","manifest_hash":"b4aae62c56c095b77be64e1819d4d3d3762cc07b121c11070dd4227b1009f8de"},"title":"普通在途","version":"2026.10","source_type":"POLICY"}]}],"result":{"answer":{"text":null}}}]}
